                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For text of a letter from President Truman to Enrico de Nicola, Provisional
                    President of the Italian Republic, upon the occasion of De Gasperi’s departure
                    from the United States, see <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the
                        Presidents of the United States: Harry S. Truman, 1947</hi>, page 105. The
                    letter, dated January 20, was released on January 25.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
